    <handDesc>
        <handNote xml:id="h1" script="Ethiopic">
            <ab type="script"/>
            <seg type="ink">Black, red</seg>
            <seg type="rubrication">
                Titles, holy names, three of four lines at the beginning of the sections, cruces ansatae.
            </seg>
            <date notBefore="1500" notAfter="1599">16th century</date>
            <desc>The handwriting retains old paleographic features: ሎ has the loop marking the 7th order attached directly to the body of the letter, without the linking line;
                the upper part of some letters, e.g. ቆ, ቶ, የ, ደ, ጸ, has a triangular shape;    መ, ዐ,  ፀ have angular loops. </desc>
        </handNote> 
    </handDesc>
    
    <additions>
        <list>
            
            <item xml:id="a1">
                <desc type="OwnershipNote">Ownership note (the name is partly erased)</desc>
                <locus target="#60r"/> 
                <q xml:lang="gez">ለገብርከ፡ <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15106WaldaLeul">ወልደ፡ ልዑል፡</persName></q>
            </item>
            
            <item xml:id="a2">
                <desc type="ScribalSupplication">The name of the scribe is  <persName role="scribe" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15107DamaKrestos">Dama Krǝstos</persName>.</desc>
                <locus target="152v"/>
                <q xml:lang="gez">ኦእግዝእ<lb/>ትየ፡ ቅድስት፡ ድንግል፡<lb/> ማርያም፡ በረከትኪ፡ ወ<lb/>በረከተ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡<lb/> ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ይኩ<lb/>ን፡ ምስለ፡ ኃጥእ፡ ወአባ<lb/>ሲ፡ ለገብ<supplied reason="omitted">ር</supplied>ኪ፡ ደመ፡ ክር<lb/>ስቶስ፡ በኵሉ፡ መዋዕለ፡<lb/> ሕይወትየ፡ ሀልዊ፡ ወት<lb/>ረ፡ ምስሌየ፡ ወኢትርሐ<lb/>ቂ፡ እምኔየ፡ ለዓለመ፡<lb/> <supplied reason="omitted">ዓ</supplied>ለም፡ አሜን። ለይኩን።</q>
              </item>
            
            <item xml:id="a3">
                <desc type="OwnershipNote">Ownership note</desc> 
                <locus target="#152v"/>
                <q xml:lang="gez">ዝመጽሐፍ፡ ዘም<lb/>ናሴ፡ ዘወሃቦ፡ ለወ<lb/>ልደ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ስላሴ፡ ፪<del>ክ<lb/>ልኤ</del>ሆሙ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ይም<lb/>ኅሮሙ፡ እግዚ<lb/>አብሔር<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ከመ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ኢ<lb/>ይትፈሃቅ፡ ውጉ<lb/>ዘ፡ <sic>ለይኵነ</sic>፤</q>
                <note>The note states that the book was owned by <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15108Menase">Mǝnāse</persName> and that was given by him to <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15109WaldaSellase">Walda Śǝllāse</persName>.</note>
            </item>
            
        </list>
